{"sections":[{"slug":"Čech脉","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Čech脉"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Čech <span lang=\"zh\">脉</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Čech 脉"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>Čech <span lang=\"zh\">脉是对范畴中的态射</span> $U\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">指定的一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\text{\\v{C}}(U\\to X)$.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $U\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是若干</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">片</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">构成的覆盖</span> $U=\\bigsqcup U_i$, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> Čech <span lang=\"zh\">脉的直观是记录其每有限个</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">片</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的交</span> $U_{i_1}\\times_X\\cdots\\times_X U_{i_k}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的结构</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于满射</span> $U\\to X$, <span lang=\"zh\">我们期望其</span> Čech <span lang=\"zh\">脉的几何实现是</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">本身</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">这称为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Giraud公理","text":"Giraud <span lang=\"zh\">公理</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>Čech <span lang=\"zh\">脉还有一种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/内部观点","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内部观点</span>"}},{"Plain":": <span lang=\"zh\">在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">于</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的语言</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/俯范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">俯范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象的内语言","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内语言</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中</span>, $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是一个点</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的覆盖</span> $U\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">则是一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/有物","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">有物</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">将这个对象的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">每两个点之间连一条线</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">每三个点之间连一个三角形</span>, …” <span lang=\"zh\">就会得到一个</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯同伦","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯同伦</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">意义下</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">可缩的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">其</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何实现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">便是一个点</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">自己</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设有范畴</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的态射</span> $f\\colon U\\to X$, <span lang=\"zh\">将其视为函子</span>\n$$\r\n    \\tilde{f}\\colon \\{[0] \\leftarrow [-1]\\}^{\\mathrm{op}}\\to\\mathcal C\r\n$$\n(<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $[0]$ <span lang=\"zh\">映射到</span> $U$, $[-1]$ <span lang=\"zh\">映射到</span> $X$). <span lang=\"zh\">考虑其沿嵌入</span>\n$$\r\n    i\\colon \\{[0] \\leftarrow [-1]\\} \\hookrightarrow \\Delta_+\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Kan扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">右</span> Kan <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{RKE}_i \\tilde f \\colon \\Delta_+^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to\\mathcal C,\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">再限制到</span> $\\Delta\\hookrightarrow\\Delta_+$, <span lang=\"zh\">所得的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">称为</span> $f$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> <strong>Čech <span lang=\"zh\">脉</span></strong> $\\text{\\v{C}}(f)\\colon \\Delta^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to \\mathcal C$.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p>Čech <span lang=\"zh\">脉是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/群胚对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群胚对象</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}